  "identifier": "sapid",
  "description": "Provides the infrastructure to implement a Strategy to Analyze Plant Extracts Taste In Depth (SAPID) by combining sensory panel profiling, projective napping, and Ascending Forced Choice (AFC) threshold testing with untargeted LC-MS feature tables, Charged Aerosol Detection (CAD) semi-quantification, taxonomically informed metabolite annotations (TIMA), and 1D proton NMR spectral clustering.",
